The WHW baseline (src/uav_shiftlab/backends/detectron2/runners.py, class WHWRunner) follows the official implementation
of "What, How, and When Should Object Detectors Update in Continually Changing Test Domains?" (Yoo et al., CVPR 2024),
https://github.com/natureyoo/ContinualTTA_ObjectDetection, released under the Apache License 2.0.

The Detectron2 backend depends on Detectron2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/detectron2, Apache License 2.0).
UAVDT data are not included and remain subject to the terms of their authors.
